---

<section class="proceso">
    <div class="inner">

        <div class="card light">
            <div class="icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"
                    stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/>
                    <path d="M9 11l3 3l8 -8"/>
                    <path d="M20 12v6a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-12a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-12a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h9"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>El cambio</h3>
            <p>
                Lo iremos logrando a partir de diferentes actividades que incluyen
                experiencias creativas, situaciones de exposición o cuestionamiento
                de aquellos pensamientos disfuncionales.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card dark">
            <div class="icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"
                    stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/>
                    <path d="M9 11l3 3l8 -8"/>
                    <path d="M20 12v6a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-12a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-12a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h9"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>El objetivo</h3>
            <p>
                Acompañarte a generar ideas más flexibles y adaptativas que
                te permitan lograr lo que te propongas.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .proceso {
        padding: 20px 0 90px;
    }

    .inner {
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        gap: 22px;
        animation: rise both;
        animation-timeline: view();
        animation-range: contain 0% contain 50%;
    }

    @keyframes rise {
        from { opacity: 0.05; transform: translateY(6vh); }
        to   { opacity: 1;    transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* ── CARDS ── */
    .card {
        flex: 1;
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 38px 36px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .card.light {
        background: #fff;
        border: 2px solid rgba(28,88,76,0.1);
        box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(28,88,76,0.06);
    }
    .card.light:hover {
        box-shadow: 0 14px 38px rgba(28,88,76,0.12);
    }

    .card.dark {
        background: #1c584c;
    }
    .card.dark:hover {
        box-shadow: 0 14px 38px rgba(28,88,76,0.35);
    }

    /* ── ICON ── */
    .icon {
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .light .icon {
        background: rgba(28,88,76,0.09);
        color: #1c584c;
    }

    .dark .icon {
        background: rgba(139,253,44,0.15);
        color: #8bfd2c;
    }

    /* ── TEXT ── */
    h3 {
        font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 24px);
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .light h3 { color: #1c584c; }
    .dark  h3 { color: #8bfd2c; }

    p {
        font-size: clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 17px);
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .light p { color: #666; }
    .dark  p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); }

    /* ── MOBILE ── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .proceso { padding: 16px 0 72px; }

        .inner {
            width: 92%;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .card { padding: 28px 26px; }
    }
</style>
